            "content": "不要把密码、Token 或授权码发到对话里。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnDzT0BBGVG5DfP9qL0F0wYf",
    "block_type": 14,
    "code": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "\n```text\nPrompt 安装：替换插件路径后，将以下整段发送到 DSH 对话里。\n\n请在当前 DSH profile 安装并启用飞书插件：\n/绝对路径/dsh-plugins/packages/dsh-feishu\n\n同时检查并协助安装：\n\n1. feishu-sync CLI：\n   python3 -m pip install --extra-index-url https://artifactory.momenta.works/artifactory/api/pypi/pypi-momenta/simple feishu-sync\n2. feishu skill：\n   npx skills install https://mcp-hub.momenta.works/wk/Momenta/public/zhixiong-public-skills/dev --skill feishu\n\n确认 skill 安装在当前 DSH 可读取的位置，并核对插件实际加载结果。\nbetter-sidebar 是面板集成的可选项，不是后台同步或对话工具的硬依赖：\n需要右侧栏「飞书」面板且当前没有该组件时再协助安装，否则跳过。\n\n先不要开启自动开工、评论协作或自动进度回写。\n飞书个人授权由我在授权页面完成；不要索取密码、Token 或授权码。\n",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "安装与授权完成后，再协助同步并检查任务清单。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "language": 1,
        "wrap": false
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnV0x2IOTvLwAgQYo8FQQaAd",
    "block_type": 27,
    "image": {
      "align": 2,
