  {
    "block_id": "doxcnw8ZApTaMt6GnMnBj6Wf8yb",
    "block_type": 4,
    "heading2": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "2. 核心功能：任务与会话双向衔接",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnsOe55aQjvQ908fQpLPWckf",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "飞书 → DSH：",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": true,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "自动或手动同步任务，在任务卡选择正确工作区。点击「绑定」关联当前会话但不投递工作；点击「开工」则绑定并开始处理。之后从任务卡直接进入对应会话。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnefwFreCTyXQ4QzNani9tTg",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "DSH → 飞书：",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": true,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "已有对话完成至少一轮助手回复后，点击「同步为飞书任务」，从会话最新结论生成飞书任务并绑定；让 AI「把当前进展写回飞书任务」，或开启「有实际进展才写回任务评论」，把改动、测试和结论留给同事。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnLtG1roPKbvBj8t5oyLhTFg",
    "block_type": 15,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "quote": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "例：把这条会话整理成一条飞书任务；之后有实际进展时写回原任务，完成前先让我确认。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnJV3V4Mt0bFvXNRAU7THTcb",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "一条任务对应一条会话，一条会话绑定一条任务。同步的是任务资料、关联和进展，不是把整段会话自动复制到每台设备。默认定期同步，可在「配置 → 同步规则」调整范围和间隔；面板筛选只改变显示。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnf4MQ4QXXXFNZ2obg7ZLLOf",
    "block_type": 27,
    "image": {
      "align": 2,
      "height": 1270,
      "scale": 1,
      "token": "VzWHbEUIsoIkBixFB6mcv9OFnVd",
