  {
    "block_id": "doxcna1ICa2nO49zIrb7Fci3i7g",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "收尾操作：",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": true,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "「完成」写飞书完成状态并归档会话；「删除会话」不删除飞书任务；「解绑」仅断开关联。会话跑完不代表任务已经交付。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnvMhJfq3U9gT7GPGhpX9N7f",
    "block_type": 4,
    "heading2": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "3. 评论协作：从手机或其他端接着推进",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnDleaPbojf8xFCTABr0bsrd",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "同事和负责人继续在飞书任务下留言，你也可以用手机补充需求；开启「配置 → 同步规则 → 评论协作」后，新评论会被识别并投递到该任务原有的 DSH 会话，处理结果再回复飞书。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "飞书负责沟通入口，DSH 承接实际工作。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": true,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnFwnKuEH8WYQTdXC40dcAyg",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "负责人评论可按「处理请求」模式识别执行意图；其他协作者默认「仅回复」，不因一条普通评论就获得执行命令或改文件的权限。先在 DSH 绑定会话并启用协作，再在飞书写清请求，例如「请补充异常情况的测试，并把验证结果回复到这里」。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnfyES2E2zRZHOSnolEYWeHf",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "首次开启只建立评论历史基线，不执行旧留言；之后识别新评论并去重。常规同步只向已绑定、未完成、未挂起且可处理的会话投递，忙碌时等待，不自动新建或唤醒冷会话；任务卡评论中的「处理」可显式唤醒符合条件的原会话。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnxOQZ0qUSVcWdvyih4VTUre",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "也可以从手机新建飞书任务，填写工作区并标注「触发条件：自动执行」，由已开启自动开工的 DSH 执行端在同步后接手，具体设置见第 6 节。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnCSQVBqhkGexLyVDUgs9kGd",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "多人围绕共享飞书任务协作，协作者需任务访问权限；每个 DSH 执行端使用自己的个人授权，一个实例不是多个账号的授权聚合器。多端留言可以回到同一个执行端，但不是跨机器复制会话或自动分布式抢单；同一任务建议指定一个 DSH 执行实例，避免多机重复处理。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnahh3EVioFlRlJWJumQ3i4d",
    "block_type": 4,
    "heading2": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "4. 文档生成：把工作成果留在任务上",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnuxPdQJUQNh2h59aMm9eFvg",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "任务卡「文档」菜单支持添加已有飞书文档，以及「AI 生成或更新」。生成时结合任务说明和绑定会话的最新结论，产出可共享的说明、设计或交付文档，并关联回任务。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnTjCpPXL8LjasXZVCF2mmCb",
    "block_type": 15,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "quote": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "例：根据这条任务和当前会话结论，生成一份精简的使用文档，保留必要步骤与验证结果，并关联到飞书任务。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcncbRfoc8SpgJypXIIBaXDBc",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "一条任务可关联多篇文档。插件生成的文档优先原地更新，手动绑定的参考文档不会因此被替换；「配置 → 文档生成」可修改生成 Prompt，「文档监听」可定期抓取指定资料的摘要。更新可能清空重写远端正文，重要文档更新前先确认。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnyJiDLCpDykpxHSNPVZ7Ntc",
    "block_type": 4,
    "heading2": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "5. 洞察：早会汇报、任务诊断与履约改进",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnxhxMu6ZWoaCvQavK5fUzsc",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "早会汇报：",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": true,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "把任务与近期进展整理成「昨天做了什么、今天做什么」的口述稿；需要让同事看到时再写入任务评论。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnLZB6kYA4XDWiL9QdyhGCAg",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "任务诊断：",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": true,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "结合优先级、工作区负载、停滞任务与延期原因，给出问题、证据和下一步建议。数字由任务快照计算，AI 负责解释，不凭空补统计。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnNerZJV016RMTmJGxAWYGjb",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "履约改进：",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": true,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "为任务设置「预期完成」，把何时交付与何时开工分开。往后改预期会保留延期／重承诺及原因，洞察据此分析准时率、偏差和反复延期，帮助调整承诺与工作量，而不是只把截止时间往后挪。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnoc5qZsPzzYJxtOMaFQfeth",
    "block_type": 15,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "quote": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "例：先同步飞书，再诊断最近延期的原因，结合履约记录给出改进建议和今天优先推进的任务；早会稿在面板点击「早会同步」生成。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcn2PtL7bx4nE1somr3cspm7d",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "先同步再看洞察；切换已有结果通常复用缓存，点 ",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "↻",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": true,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": " 才请求重新生成。齿轮中可自定义问题和 Prompt。生成洞察可能消耗模型额度；「写入评论」会真正写回飞书。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
