  {
    "block_id": "doxcnAmWVVgnxe9BHxkgY3xFvGf",
    "block_type": 4,
    "heading2": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "6. 自动化执行：按时做、自动做，不必守着页面",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    },
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f"
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnBr0tFeX0pe5KiCkiUs2gnb",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "新任务自动执行：",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": true,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "在「同步规则 → 自动开工」开启受控范围，优先选择「只开标注过的」，并限制每轮数量；在飞书清单设置工作区和「触发条件：自动执行」。同步时会检查任务条件与前置依赖，然后开工。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnU4TxA3ykXUGHkX1hNYh8mb",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "每日或指定时间执行：",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": true,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "先绑定会话，在「同步规则 → 排期与定时 → 定时触发指令」配置到点要做什么（例如检查任务进展并回写飞书）；再在任务卡「定时」输入时间、预览并保存。也可直接对 DSH 说：",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnXhbW5JrKUmYvlEoK6ZW9vb",
    "block_type": 15,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "quote": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "把这条已绑定任务设为每天上午 9 点执行，先预览，确认后保存。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnR6KfT7RzzRIVNHmQC0ujvf",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "触发指令是全局模板，在新建或重设定时时写入规则；修改模板后，已有规则需重设才能使用新指令。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnXzXhFOlyB7IQtsISS4p6hh",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "自动安排今天：",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": true,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "让 DSH 按优先级和可用时间给出时间块，先人工核对依赖，确认后落地；今日排期不等于每天自动重新规划。请区分「定时」是何时做，「预期」是何时交付，「挂起」是暂时不做；清单上的「按时执行」字段不等于已经建立每日重复规则。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnmDV0edHqcyoyR5VyyaQ3bg",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "定时要求已绑定会话且 DSH 自动化服务可用；保存或清除定时会影响该会话的其他自动化记录，操作前核对。定时投递不等于成功完成任务，请查看执行结果。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "block_id": "doxcnJgDdWQxy8RbvqcFzOX4qwc",
    "block_type": 2,
    "parent_id": "TrMvddkf2oCpmTxf14hcvfLrn6f",
    "text": {
      "elements": [
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "不需要一直打开 DSH 页面或飞书面板：由后台 Host 同步、投递和运行会话。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "前提是 DSH 后台持续运行、执行机可用，且授权、网络、模型与自动化服务正常。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": true,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text_run": {
            "content": "关闭浏览器页面与退出 DSH 后台是两回事；应用彻底退出、机器关机或休眠时，不保证执行或补跑。自动化也不能绕过需要人工批准的操作。",
            "text_element_style": {
              "bold": false,
              "inline_code": false,
              "italic": false,
              "strikethrough": false,
              "underline": false
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "style": {
        "align": 1,
        "folded": false
      }
    }
  },
